commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T13:56:49Z","email":"volkan.tagal@getir.com","name":"Volkan Tağal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T13:56:49Z","email":"volkan.tagal@getir.com","name":"Volkan Tağal"},"message":"fix: protect __V_styles__ placeholder from prettier reformatting\n\nPrettier rewrote the bare \"__V_styles__\" statement in src/client/client.js\nas (''__V_styles__''); which no longer matches the exact double-quoted search\nstring in config/string.js. The placeholder was never replaced with\nrequire(<global styles>), esbuild dropped the dead statement, and builds\nstopped emitting client.css entirely — consumer apps lost all global styles\n(CSS variables, fonts, body reset). This shipped broken in 1.0.12.\n\nRestore the double-quoted literal and add a prettier-ignore pragma so the\nnext format pass cannot break it again. The explanatory comment deliberately\navoids the quoted literal because the replacement only targets the first\noccurrence in the file.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"766911842a07d7633078f7fcc7dac4bcf2c70c50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/volkantagal-g/Piramite/git/trees/766911842a07d7633078f7fcc7dac4bcf2c70c50"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/volkantagal-g/Piramite/git/commits/fbea6afd02e724aea7a9a2dbd3d0590fdced4533","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216488536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/volkantagal-g/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/volkantagal-g/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/volkantagal-g/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/volkantagal-g/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/volkantagal-g","id":216488536,"login":"volkantagal-g","node_id":"U_kgDODOdaWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.co