s\n- Added comprehensive button variants and states\n- Integrated loading animations and accessibility features\n- Professional test pages created for all components\n\n🏗️ TECHNICAL ACHIEVEMENTS:\n- CSS classes only integration approach proven successful\n- Card component naming consolidated (professionalCard.js → card.js)\n- Backward compatibility maintained with alias support\n- Enterprise features (type safety, WCAG AAA, performance) intact\n\n🔧 CODE QUALITY:\n- Lint warnings reduced from 28 to 16 (remaining in OLD-BACKUP files)\n- All active components lint-clean\n- Integration methodology validated for remaining components\n\n🎯 NEXT PHASE:\n- 2 remaining components: badge.js (402 lines), tooltip.js (44 lines)\n- Integration approach proven and documented\n- Ready for Phase 2: Layout Systems Integration\n\nThis commit preserves all integration work and prevents cache reset issues.","tree":{"sha":"0675642e443c02f03afd8767ed6540902beb8dd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/justindepierro/boxcall-OLD/git/trees/0675642e443c02f03afd8767ed6540902beb8dd0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/justindepierro/boxcall-OLD/git/commits/f2709f98e872e1c255738911fea49dde4d1f5d6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218412328?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justindepierro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justindepierro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justindepierro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justindepierro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/justindepierro","id":218412328,"login":"justindepierro","node_id":"U_kgDODQS1KA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justindepierro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justindepierro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.