ehensive Cleanup:\n• Fixed all linting errors and code quality issues\n• Standardized import paths and file headers\n• Removed deprecated sidebar implementations\n• Updated README with complete feature documentation\n• Enhanced project structure with proper organization\n\n🔧 Technical Improvements:\n• Updated build system with PWA bundle optimization\n• Enhanced main.js with PWA initialization\n• Updated index.html with complete PWA meta tags\n• Created diagnostic tools for layout and component analysis\n• Implemented bulletproof error handling throughout\n\n📊 Project Status:\n• Build time: 1.65s (excellent performance)\n• PWA bundle: 11.55kB (optimized size)\n• All phases documented with interactive demos\n• Professional README with linkable navigation\n• Ready for production deployment\n\nThis commit represents the completion of Phase 6A PWA Excellence,\nmaking BoxCall a fully-featured Progressive Web App with offline\ncapabilities, professional documentation, and a clean codebase\nready for advanced features implementation.","tree":{"sha":"ac3741e94b1329d11aea9f32e34895293b3abca4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/justindepierro/boxcall-OLD/git/trees/ac3741e94b1329d11aea9f32e34895293b3abca4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/justindepierro/boxcall-OLD/git/commits/c6fef3338dff5bb8e5c4164683fd85c4287918dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218412328?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justindepierro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justindepierro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justindepierro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justindepierro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/justindepierro","id":218412328,"login":"justindepierro","node_id":"U_kgDODQS1KA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.co