ro"},"message":"🏆 Major System Enhancement & Organization Cleanup\n\n✅ CORE FEATURES COMPLETED:\n• Professional login page with optimized spacing (mobile-friendly)\n• Owner account authentication with super_admin privileges\n• Enhanced role-based access control and dev tools integration\n• Professional style system implementation across all pages\n• Complete component standardization with semantic variants\n\n🗂️ PROJECT ORGANIZATION:\n• Restructured documentation into organized docs/ folder\n• Moved database files to dedicated database/ directory\n• Relocated test files to test-data/ for better organization\n• Archived completed documentation to docs/archived/\n• Created comprehensive completion reports and status docs\n\n🎨 DESIGN SYSTEM IMPROVEMENTS:\n• 8 semantic button variants (.btn-primary, .btn-secondary, etc.)\n• Professional card patterns with consistent theming\n• Unified form styling and status indicators\n• Advanced CSS features (animations, accessibility, utilities)\n• Future-ready Tailwind v4 preparation files\n\n🔧 TECHNICAL ENHANCEMENTS:\n• Owner account bypass for development access (justindepierro@gmail.com)\n• Enhanced authentication flow with database independence\n• Improved sidebar system with better navigation\n• Professional component architecture across all pages\n• Mobile-optimized layouts and responsive design\n\n🔐 AUTHENTICATION FIXES:\n• Fixed owner account blocked access issue\n• Enhanced role detection for super_admin privileges\n• Improved dev tools access for development accounts\n• Better session management and persistent login\n\n📚 DOCUMENTATION:\n• Complete design system guide with usage examples\n• Comprehensive project roadmaps and status reports\n• Technical completion summaries with metrics\n• Future development plans and migration guides\n\nThis commit represents a major milestone in BoxCall development with professional-grade styling, robust authentication, and organized project structure ready for Phase 3 development.","tree"