ystem\n\n🎮 Enhanced Game Mode integration:\n- Field position controls with realistic football positions\n- Updated sample playbook with field-position-specific plays\n- Proper field position display using new descriptive system\n- Interactive field position buttons (Own 20, Midfield, Red Zone, etc.)\n\n🧮 Mathematical improvements:\n- Fixed field crossing logic for midfield transitions\n- Accurate distance calculations across field boundaries\n- Proper coordinate system (-49 to +50, with 50 = midfield)\n- UI slider mapping for visual field representations\n\n🎯 Play calling enhancements:\n- Field-position-aware play recommendations\n- Context-based play type suggestions\n- Risk assessment for conservative vs aggressive play calling\n- Red zone and goal line specific play categorization\n\n📝 Code quality:\n- Comprehensive documentation with football field diagrams\n- Clean TypeScript integration\n- 0 lint errors\n- Extensive test coverage for field math calculations\n\nThis creates a robust foundation for intelligent, field-position-aware play calling that coaches will find intuitive and useful.","tree":{"sha":"5443f7421ae3fd33d6e539344d1bd30556b7b977","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/justindepierro/boxcall-OLD/git/trees/5443f7421ae3fd33d6e539344d1bd30556b7b977"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/justindepierro/boxcall-OLD/git/commits/42a1e7b62ae7629bbb23361da36d22564c1684ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218412328?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justindepierro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justindepierro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justindepierro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justindepierro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/justindepierro","id":218412328,"login":"justindepierro",