ases, so the exact Angular pins move within 21.2.\n\n## Dependency bumps (exact pins kept)\n\n- @angular/animations, common, compiler, compiler-cli, core, elements, forms, localize, platform-browser, platform-browser-dynamic, router 21.2.20 → 21.2.25\n- @angular/build, @angular/cli 21.2.21 → 21.2.26\n\n## Lockfile updates (bump and `npm audit fix`)\n\n- @angular/router 21.2.20 → 21.2.25\n- piscina 5.2.0 → 5.3.2 and undici 7.29.0 → 7.29.1 (via @angular/build 21.2.26), undici 6.28.0 → 6.29.0\n- @modelcontextprotocol/sdk 1.30.0 → 1.31.0 (via @angular/cli 21.2.26)\n- proxy-addr 2.0.7 → 2.0.8\n- ip-address 10.5.0 → 10.7.3\n- http-cache-semantics 4.2.0 → 4.3.0\n- probe-image-size 7.3.0 → 7.4.0\n- source-map-js 1.2.1 → 1.2.2\n- brace-expansion 1.1.18 → 1.1.21, 2.1.4 → 2.1.7, 5.0.9 → 5.0.12\n\n## Override\n\n- shell-quote 1.9.0 → 1.11.0 via `overrides`; concurrently 9.2.4 pins shell-quote 1.9.0 exactly\n\n## Not fixable\n\n- braces 3.0.3 (GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm): no patched version published yet; dev only, via lint-staged/micromatch\n\n## Verification\n\n`npm ci`, `npm install`, `npm run build` and `npm test` (lib, ui and wc projects) pass.\n\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP grzegorz.krajniak@sap.com\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"249c35236d597b0b86deb9cba7fb4b483d995f47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/iam-ui/git/trees/249c35236d597b0b86deb9cba7fb4b483d995f47"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/iam-ui/git/commits/6ef5411483bebac607f6c807837d8f516314d771","verification":{"payload":"tree 249c35236d597b0b86deb9cba7fb4b483d995f47\nparent f18c217bf2f7d070136978ed850ecb85c1ddb18d\nauthor Grzegorz Krajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com> 1791363586 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791363586 +0400\n\nfix(deps): bump Angular to 21.2.25 and resolve vulnerabilities (#112)\n\n## Summary\n\nResolves the open Dependabot alerts and the fixable `npm audit` findings. The @angular/router advisory and the undici/piscina fixes need newer Angular 21 patch releases, so the exact Angular pins move within 21.2.\n\n## Dependency bumps (exact pins kept)\n\n- @angular/animations, common, compiler, compiler-cli, core, elements, forms, localize, platform-browser, platform-browser-dynamic, router 21.2.20 → 21.2.25\n- @angular/build, @angular/cli 21.2.21 → 21.2.26\n\n## Lockfile updates (bump and `npm audit fix`)\n\n- @angular/router 21.2.20 → 21.2.25\n- piscina 5.2.0 → 5.3.2 and undici 7.29.0 → 7.29.1 (via @angular/build 21.2.26), undici 6.28.0 → 6.29.0\n- @modelcontextprotocol/sdk 1.30.0 → 1.31.0 (via @angular/cli 21.2.26)\n- proxy-addr 2.0.7 → 2.0.8\n- ip-address 10.5.0 → 10.7.3\n- http-cache-semantics 4.2.0 → 4.3.0\n- probe-image-size 7.3.0 → 7.4.0\n- source-map-js 1.2.1 → 1.2.2\n- brace-expansion 1.1.18 → 1.1.21, 2.1.4 → 2.1.7, 5.0.9 → 5.0.12\n\n## Override\n\n- shell-quote 1.9.0 → 1.11.0 via `overrides`; concurrently 9.2.4 pins shell-quote 1.9.0 exactly\n\n## Not fixable\n\n- braces 3.0.3 (GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm): no patched version published yet; dev only, via lint-staged/micromatch\n\n## Verification\n\n`npm ci`, `npm install`, `npm run build` and `npm test` (lib, ui and wc projects) pass.\n\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP grzegorz.krajniak@sap.com\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxgoCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgs0QAERwRfz2PMKX6f5ZBsyF9wVA\nC71X58BKYkQv8X3zEiXuSayzqGwiGPRgfOv+1JPEY+AhYSLUGnpl8vyb8GqFGZJh\noVQEgwmhgWEjp6A92xoBAykxNl/S0iHM2tlFY4JvjnUJ0DTJgjeUm2dxdJSWYXin\nYGqu4tk1un80rCVhwudxM9KPK3OZRNlAVojqq0CNLaXpwei4YmTqbUUHptP/MuER\nomT8DDe3HpHlVuOA1GG9RR0/fk6daSwAEM5R2q7lWYYQELcYRi4x2ue4bCXODGZg\n/zzFJdq/bk7qltuiVdwqJNKvgm7Fa3VLUiXfUaA02FW5eQNxAqrMO2cZA3LviAIN\nqcwpX74WrTUpHcGuDxxBXv8PpE5h5LImAFOkvGh3enfjsPsPIU1MjXxX1+YiWAyT\nc1XEo5j7F4mVymbBmRcHQi/ayu2J9wgykAZIFx7Jkw++zUAsaK+1TREU1Xxzc2k5\n0APAuHuA65hvlYsP6bqhoJ6uEb8PHHsH6CuMCofzv+emeB1hXFfRQ3/C5OBW8odh\nQuZJAnvKeQul/5T9QpX+G+kjvGS16yLSK7STFKIek31yKcyUa4MmTq6mQ6VMAz6A\n3DDacxBZ