api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/iam-ui/commits/18f1df43dabe74bd89263af3f8420ea1db155830/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T08:31:28Z","email":"gkrajniak@gmail.com","name":"Grzegorz Krajniak"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T08:31:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: patch dependency vulnerabilities (30 → 0) (#100)\n\nBump Angular packages to 21.2.20 / 21.2.21 to resolve high-severity\nadvisories (XSS sanitization bypasses in @angular/compiler; DoS and\nHttpTransferCache cross-request data leakage in @angular/common) and\npull in patched transitive deps (tar, undici, postcss, vite, @babel/core,\npiscina, @hono/node-server).\n\nAdd an esbuild override to 0.28.1 to close the remaining dev-server\narbitrary-file-read advisory that ng-packagr''s ^0.27.0 range would\notherwise pin to a vulnerable version.\n\nnpm audit: 30 vulnerabilities (1 critical, 25 high) → 0.\nVerified: build:lib and build:ui both compile cleanly.\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"db510ad55cb67140cefa5df9fcc0728f9b11dc91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/iam-ui/git/trees/db510ad55cb67140cefa5df9fcc0728f9b11dc91"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/iam-ui/git/commits/18f1df43dabe74bd89263af3f8420ea1db155830","verification":{"payload":"tree db510ad55cb67140cefa5df9fcc0728f9b11dc91\nparent d1fe9dff2625a9ff2703047cc1c557c44e2d900b\nauthor Grzegorz Krajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com> 1786609888 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786609888 +0000\n\nfix: patch dependency vulnerabilities (30 → 0) (#100)\n\nBump Angular packages to 21.2.20 / 21.2.21 to resolve high-severity\nadvisories (XSS sanitization bypasses in @angular/compiler; DoS and\nHttpTransferCache cross-request data leakage in @angular/common) and\npull in patched transitive deps (tar, undici, postcss, vite, @babel/core,\npiscina, @hono/node-server).\n\nAdd an esbuild override to 0.28.1 to close the remaining dev-server\narbitrary-file-read advisory that ng-packagr''s ^0.27.0 range would\notherwise pin to a vulnerable version.\n\nnpm audit: 30 vulnerabilities (1 critical, 25 high) → 0.\nVerified: build:lib and build:ui both compile cleanly.\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfYDgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAX2sQAE2CVQKdiZWZHewFviA/8bJh\n/0kVs3unAgEF7zN3bCun1JyPtgXmLFmyNtRtZmzpJ8fWUIGble/COf3qdsgt+06x\nGHs9XKE293MW+40Y/jwjbdEopBfmdjbs1iBjthF8wYhKdxoAp+oXRA8geFW45TAw\n4n235OwUKyG1yktS/K9ExilkLdPV56X5LvAZfMkIRkZ03rC51gxyBm9OviUBS79t\nc2wR2IBQQfY4g63+5RXalr8bwUHiTnKNmpJGHuRRRRo9wa63vshEAZhos3wnhdDw\nQhwZKL90XYC65+m00q5g4fT/BjiwvWq6VgBra1ekCuH3fSYB34anavGofRSTgNgE\nCXahwXFEnbxnSXnJe0DhfvrqsTdvk6vOQk38Fpw5+FDNeaQmK1t3vRZMlzJBA/fk\nrijaeBYYr4XQTew9rQCdZRa/LuK8FcuOpf1JFIcFsWuvmUYTsz/kdASFBjlqvR7y\n7jwmDez9J9Ba121g67lpp76zYEyrRGedH332q3cmwGnrYIXifMfnuXf4WkFjzglf\n+wekj9SMSxs8b2YV4/cwG1F92dIUT+T/eOROooOcwq/kPeBpydLtlbgesLBJ4rQe\nVroT3sTWSatgh1wtz3mDocbCFAqhC/iXgulDyN0BqByigGDJ5ZTL6k1bm3QuPDNH\nN+ZRFAkrdHbcwWn6YDMr\n=LmGI\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-13T08:31:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/