agement system by replacing the legacy inline cell\nediting components with a more robust set of hooks and services. This\nincludes a complete overhaul of view preferences to support saved view\npresets and bulk actions.\n\n- Remove deprecated `RecordInlineCell` component hierarchy.\n- Introduce `useBulkActions`, `useContactPicker`, and `useSavedViewPresets`\n  hooks.\n- Add `RecordPicker` modal component.\n- Refactor `viewPreferences.service.ts` to use a new `view_preferences`\n  table structure supporting object-specific presets.\n- Update contact-related hooks (`useContactAttachments`, `useContactTimeline`)\n  for improved stability and cleaner dependency management.\n- Update Supabase migration to use standard SQL syntax and enhanced\n  constraints for contact enhancements.","tree":{"sha":"2c78d67a26021285fbfb2dc790ad18ff58f17611","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/contactsfeature/git/trees/2c78d67a26021285fbfb2dc790ad18ff58f17611"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/contactsfeature/git/commits/543456be204f47fc0918236817da965393f46f39","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/2193792?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilo-code-bot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilo-code-bot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilo-code-bot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilo-code-bot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/kilo-code-bot","id":240665456,"login":"kilo-code-bot[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDODlhDcA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilo-code-bot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilo-code-bot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilo-code-bot%5Bbot%5D/repos",