ard pnpm install command.\n\n* refactor(ui): remove unused imports and components in SmartCRMApp\n\nRemove NetlifyAuthProvider, EnhancedNavbar, Sidebar, Dashboard, Pipeline, Products, UserManagement, GTMPromptHub, and LandingPage imports to clean up the main application entry point.\n\n* refactor: simplify to standalone contacts application\n\n- Remove navbar, sidebar, and multi-section navigation\n- SmartCRMApp now just renders the Contacts page directly\n- No more landing, dashboard, pipeline, products, AI tools, etc.\n- Standalone contacts view with clickable contacts\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: kiloconnect[bot] <240665456+kiloconnect[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f7f0ab90758165398f370432cb9a7829b2671fb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/contactsfeature/git/trees/f7f0ab90758165398f370432cb9a7829b2671fb4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/contactsfeature/git/commits/35eecfae057e2ecfddf5bd87884429477bef3f4e","verification":{"payload":"tree f7f0ab90758165398f370432cb9a7829b2671fb4\nparent e3df6aa9e16fbe589652ebe826aa948090557034\nauthor kilo-code-bot[bot] <240665456+kilo-code-bot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1780491563 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780491563 +0000\n\nrefactor: simplify to standalone contacts app (#6)\n\n* fix: use pnpm.onlyBuiltDependencies for esbuild, @parcel/watcher, core-js-pure\n\nPNPM 11+ requires onlyBuiltDependencies in package.json instead of\nallowing scripts globally. Also updated netlify.toml to use\nstandard pnpm install command.\n\n* refactor(ui): remove unused imports and components in SmartCRMApp\n\nRemove NetlifyAuthProvider, EnhancedNavbar, Sidebar, Dashboard, Pipeline, Products, UserManagement, GTMPromptHub, and LandingPage imports to clean up the main application entry point.\n\n* refactor: simplify to standalone contacts application\n\n- Remove navbar, sidebar, and multi-section navigation\n- SmartCRMApp now just renders the Contacts page directly\n- 