nect[bot]"},"message":"feat(ui): implement module federation support for host integration\n\nEnable the application to be loaded as a remote module within a host\napplication (app.smartcrm.vip) by implementing the SmartCRM remote\nprops contract and configuring Vite module federation.\n\n- Implement `SmartCRMRemoteProps` interface in `App.tsx` to handle\n  shared data, initial routing, and event callbacks.\n- Add lifecycle hooks to notify the host of mounting, navigation,\n  and modal closure events.\n- Configure `@originjs/vite-plugin-federation` to expose the `App`\n  component.\n- Add a custom Vite plugin `fixFederationCssForVite8` to patch\n  `remoteEntry.js` and resolve CSS virtual module issues compatible\n  with Vite 8/Rolldown.\n- Add diagnostic logging to verify module federation status at\n  runtime.","tree":{"sha":"cdc2453e52c1a69504cc6ce47e4cd8cddbf31c63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/contactsfeature/git/trees/cdc2453e52c1a69504cc6ce47e4cd8cddbf31c63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/contactsfeature/git/commits/6d869b60adc8a83ab092e0f10597cd6ad0a734ed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/2193792?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilo-code-bot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilo-code-bot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilo-code-bot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilo-code-bot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/kilo-code-bot","id":240665456,"login":"kilo-code-bot[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDODlhDcA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilo-code-bot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilo-code-bot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/use