,"name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-31T13:36:15Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"fix(deploy): align vite and typescript alias configurations\n\nThe application was failing to deploy to Netlify because of an issue with path alias resolution. The alias configurations in `vite.config.ts` and `tsconfig.app.json` were misaligned with the project''s directory structure, causing the build to fail in the case-sensitive Linux environment used by Netlify.\n\nThis commit fixes the issue by:\n1.  Updating the `paths` and `include` in `tsconfig.app.json` to correctly point to the `client/src` directory.\n2.  Refining the aliases in `vite.config.ts` to use more precise `find` patterns and absolute paths.\n\nThese changes create a single, consistent source of truth for path resolution, which resolves the build error on Netlify.","tree":{"sha":"2318fac50cdf1665940dd82e3f9818d7486c85c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/smartcrmdash/git/trees/2318fac50cdf1665940dd82e3f9818d7486c85c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/smartcrmdash/git/commits/b5bb16f4022a52925416e89bf8c9da19d8e98314","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-ju