6f59f3c396f05c829d67b46fdd07c19491d5","sha":"417e6f59f3c396f05c829d67b46fdd07c19491d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/417e6f59f3c396f05c829d67b46fdd07c19491d5"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/0c57e825c9f60947eb9e8d3e10dff0354b5b185e","sha":"0c57e825c9f60947eb9e8d3e10dff0354b5b185e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/0c57e825c9f60947eb9e8d3e10dff0354b5b185e"}],"sha":"182c26c8be5a30de72a3a679b6c1d9a808edc774","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/182c26c8be5a30de72a3a679b6c1d9a808edc774"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/0c57e825c9f60947eb9e8d3e10dff0354b5b185e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T13:07:31Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T13:07:31Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"test(cart): tests de caracterizacion del carrito de compras\n\nPrimeros tests sobre logica de NEGOCIO. Los 71 que habia eran todos de la capa\nde plataforma; cartStore.ts son 930 lineas con 45 referencias a plata —lo que\nse le cobra al cliente— y no tenia ninguno.\n\nNo describen como \"deberia\" calcular el carrito: congelan lo que hace HOY. Son\nla red que hace falta antes de tocar las pantallas de venta que lo consumen,\ndonde hay ~1078 lineas duplicadas entre crear y editar.\n\n47 tests en dos archivos:\n\ncartStore.money.test.ts (20)\n  subtotales por linea y del carrito, precision decimal (0.1 + 0.2 = 0.3),\n  precio y subtotal editables con derivacion inversa del precio unitario,\n  descuento por monto y por porcentaje con sus topes, y el recalculo al\n  cambiar el carrito.\n\ncartStore.stock.test.ts (27)\n  los tres modos (sale-strict, sale-permissive, quote), cantidades invalidas,\n  canAddProduct, validateCart y la conversion de cotizacion a venta.\n\nDOS COMPORTAMIENTOS QUE CONVIENE CONOCER, descubiertos escribiendo los tests:\n\n1. `validateCart()` NO valida en modos permisivos: devuelve siempre\n   isValid: true. La validacion real ocurre recien al pasar a sale-strict.\n   Quien la llame desde una pantalla en modo quote y confie en el resultado va\n   a creer que el carrito esta bien cuando nadie lo miro.\n\n2. `canAddProduct()` devuelve el campo `available` (no `availableToAdd`) y SOLO\n   en el caso de rechazo. En el caso feliz responde `{ canAdd: true }` a secas.\n\nLos dos son comportamiento actual, no bugs; quedan documentados en los tests\npara que nadie los descubra en produccion.\n\nVerificado por mutacion: sacar el tope del descuento contra el subtotal hace\nfallar exactamente el test que lo cubre.\n\n118/118 tests en total. typecheck 124 en checkout limpio, igual que\ndevelopment. eslint limpio.","tree":{"sha":"7d9dea7277fa80f2c1be683c6405f1494e249112","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/7d9dea7277fa80f2c1be683c6405f1494e249112"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/0c57e825c9f60947eb9e8d3e10dff0354b5b185e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/0c57e825c9f60947eb9e8d3e10dff0354b5b185e","node_id":"C_kwDOPFR1DNoAKDBjNTdlODI1YzlmNjA5NDdlYjllOGQzZTEwZGZmMDM1NGI1YjE4NWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/417e6f59f3c396f05c829d67b46fdd07c19491d5","sha":"417e6f59f3c396f05c829d67b46fdd07c19491d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/417e6f59f3c396f05c829d67b46fdd07c19491d5"}],"sha":"0c57e825c9f60947eb9e8d3e10dff0354b5b185e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/0c57e825c9f60947eb9e8d3e10dff0354b5b185e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/6daaa0508480928de21f3d682996c4c3a2261daf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T09:52:51Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T09:52:51Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"fix(plugins): corregir los 2 errores de tipos que la rama agregaba\n\nCon estos, la rama deja de sumar deuda: pasa de 126 a 124 errores en un\ncheckout limpio, exactamente el baseline de development. El trinquete del CI\n(.typecheck-baseline) rechaza cualquier PR que aumente la cuenta, asi que sin\nesto el merge quedaba bloqueado.\n\n1. helloPlugin: createHelloViewComponent declaraba devolver\n   `() => React.ReactElement`. Ese tipo desnudo no tiene `displayName`, que se\n   asigna unas lineas mas abajo para React DevTools. Pasa a React.FC, que si lo\n   declara.\n\n2. pluginDialogStore: el cast de `resolve` fallaba porque los callbacks son\n   contravariantes en su parametro, asi que `(value: T) => void` no es\n   asignable a `(value: boolean | PromptResult) => void`. Se pasa por `unknown`\n   —que es lo que el cast ya asumia— y se documenta por que en la practica los\n   tipos coinciden: cada llamador instancia T con el tipo de su dialogo.\n\ntypecheck 124 en checkout limpio, 71/71 tests, ambos builds OK.","tree":{"sha":"0d3d09d8f491002e7b577a58e2223dbff31ea111","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/0d3d09d8f491002e7b577a58e2223dbff31ea111"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/6daaa0508480928de21f3d682996c4c3a2261daf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/6daaa0508480928de21f3d682996c4c3a2261daf","node_id":"C_kwDOPFR1DNoAKDZkYWFhMDUwODQ4MDkyOGRlMjFmM2Q2ODI5OTZjNGMzYTIyNjFkYWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/bf66b21d74ca2b794ffb10c531c5aab7661fa21a","sha":"bf66b21d74ca2b794ffb10c531c5aab7661fa21a","url":