21Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T09:34:26Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"feat(plugins): loader externo Module Federation + Rust + UI de gestión (Fase 4)\n\n- vite: federation always-on (shared react/react-dom/jsx-runtime singleton 19.1.0, zustand, router, sdk)\n- rust: comandos get/install/uninstall/set_enabled + asset protocol scope dinamico\n- kernel: loadExternalPlugins() generaliza el loader del PoC (inyeccion de PluginSource)\n- ui: pantalla de gestion de plugins en Configuracion (instalar/activar/desactivar/desinstalar)\n- bootstrap: load-results expuestos via modulo propio sin romper code-splitting","tree":{"sha":"72810cec7c3d865b0422a11d710c7d0ad6012b58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/72810cec7c3d865b0422a11d710c7d0ad6012b58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/580063c4f253b8755ea95bb8d7316d9d66ac00bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/use