:0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T09:33:59Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"feat(plugins): cablear PluginAPI a producción (Fase 3)\n\nCablea todo el PluginAPI del kernel a producción de forma aditiva, sin\nromper rutas/sidebar/tabs existentes:\n\n- RouteRegistry reactivo (subscribe/notify) + hook useRegistryRoutes\n  (useSyncExternalStore con snapshot estable).\n- Navigation + TabContainer + useTabNavigation mergean las rutas del\n  registry en su resolución (TPS resuelve vistas vía TabContainer, no\n  via Outlet de React Router — por eso el merge va en ambos motores).\n- Sidebar reactivo: appSidebar consume getSidebarSections/getSettingsActions\n  (bus subscribeUI + caché estable) respetando filtrado por rol.\n- confirm/prompt cableados a Radix vía pluginDialogStore (Promise + cola\n  FIFO) + PluginDialogHost montado en main.\n- tabStore: routeId? aditivo en Tab; getActiveTab/onTabChange cableados;\n  useTabNavigation inyecta routeId al abrir rutas de plugin.\n- registerKeybinding: registry aislado de plugins + PluginKeybindingHost\n  (listener global, no toca el sistema nativo de keybindings).\n- HOST_CAPABILITIES: + tabs, keybindings.\n- Plugin interno dev-only (__dev__/helloPlugin) tras flag VITE_DEV_PLUGINS\n  para validación end-to-end.","tree":{"sha":"3a6bda0a21adbf702ee460b037275f89f5370d2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/3a6bda0a21adbf702ee460b037275f89f5370d2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/f30fcfcf3be443b99d37ba6b2d03c2286fec0835","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{