pi.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/7e94f7da9660afbeba138dba11e6cbadebe5c9d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T04:11:25Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T04:11:25Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"build: arreglar el script build y poner un gate real de tipos\n\nEl script `build` era \"tsc && vite build\", pero ese `tsc` NUNCA verifico nada:\ntsconfig.json raiz es solution-style (\"files\": [] + references), asi que\ncompila cero archivos y siempre sale verde. El repo lleva tiempo compilando\nsin typecheck real, y esa red falsa ya oculto 8 errores durante la migracion a\nla capa de puertos, uno de ellos una regresion funcional.\n\nAhora `build` es `vite build` a secas: deja de mentir. El gate vive aparte.\n\nTRINQUETE EN VEZ DE CERO ERRORES\n\nEl repo arrastra 124 errores de tipos preexistentes. Exigir cero hoy bloquearia\ntodos los PRs, y arreglarlos es un proyecto propio: 57 son mecanicos (imports y\nvariables sin usar) pero los otros 67 necesitan criterio, y algunos parecen\nbugs reales — hay variables calculadas que nunca se usan, del mismo tipo que el\nclassName roto encontrado en el selector de compras.\n\nscripts/typecheck-ratchet.sh hace lo unico sostenible: que la deuda NO CREZCA.\nCompara contra .typecheck-baseline, falla si aparecen errores nuevos, y avisa\ncuando bajan para que se actualice el numero. Cuando llegue a 0 se reemplaza\npor `npm run typecheck` y se borra el script.\n\nVerificado por mutacion: introducir un error de tipos hace que falle con\nexit 1 y liste los errores.\n\nPRIMER CI QUE CORRE EN PRs\n\nLos tres workflows existentes son builds manuales o por tag; ningun PR se\nvalidaba. .github/workflows/pr-checks.yml corre el trinquete y los tests en\ncada PR contra development.\n\nNota: en local el trinquete reporta 126 en vez de 124. Los 2 extra vienen de\nsrc/modules/sales/screens/createSaleScreenUnificado.tsx, un archivo de 1430\nlineas sin trackear en git, que nadie importa y sin tocar desde abril. En un\ncheckout limpio no existe, asi que en CI da 124.","tree":{"sha":"8d49015c2494ba13ee78f3071ec8912c96f903a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/8d49015c2494ba13ee78f3071ec8912c96f903a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/7e94f7da9660afbeba138dba11e6cbadebe5c9d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.g