_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/ccbf72299d9716ddcd4db37fb05250b68653b264/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:46:24Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:46:24Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"chore: sacar Cargo.lock del diff de la rama\n\nEntro por accidente en el commit de los selectores via `git add -A`. Es un\nartefacto de build cuya version sigue a Cargo.toml; no tiene nada que ver con\nla capa de puertos y solo agrega ruido al review.\n\nVuelve al estado de development.","tree":{"sha":"1f5745ea3a74fdb0a42608b3cf687e0d16e93bee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/1f5745ea3a74fdb0a42608b3cf687e0d16e93bee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/ccbf72299d9716ddcd4db37fb05250b68653b264","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/ccbf72299d9716ddcd4db37fb05250b68653b264","node_id":"C_kwDOPFR1DNoAKGNjYmY3MjI5OWQ5NzE2ZGRjZDRkYjM3ZmIwNTI1MGI2ODY1M2IyNjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/a07f165c0d9439019aa7478c08dcdab766df33b9","sha":"a07f165c0d9439019aa7478c08dcdab766df33b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/a07f165c0d9439019aa7478c08dcdab766df33b9"}],"sha":"ccbf72299d9716ddcd4db37fb05250b68653b264","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/ccbf72299d9716ddcd4db37fb05250b68653b264"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/49fa407cb217c4f2fa0913c41749061653b4983e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T23:44:20Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:39:09Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"fix(platform): corregir 8 errores de tipos que un typecheck mal invocado oculto\n\nEl typecheck que verifico los 8 commits anteriores era FALSO. tsconfig.json es\nun config de tipo solution (\"files\": [] + references), asi que\n`npx tsc --noEmit` no compila NI UN archivo. El comando correcto es\n`npx tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.app.json`.\n\nNota: el script `build` de package.json (\"tsc && vite build\") arrastra el mismo\nproblema y nunca verifico tipos. Se deja como esta para no romper el build con\nlos 129 errores preexistentes; hay que decidirlo aparte.\n\nErrores introducidos y corregidos:\n\n- ProductSelectorWindow, quotationSelectorWindow y SaleDetailSelectorWindow:\n  quedaba `currentWindow` en arrays de dependencias tras renombrar la variable\n  a `platformWindows`. Rompia en runtime al abrir el selector de productos.\n- KeybindingsSettings: quedaban dos referencias a `filePath`, que dejo de\n  existir al pasar al puerto. Ahora usa `picked.name`.\n- adapters/tauri/windowChrome: `setZoom` vive en WebviewWindow, no en Window.\n  Se usa getCurrentWebviewWindow() solo para esa operacion.\n- platformStateStorage: `erasableSyntaxOnly` prohibe propiedades de parametro\n  en el constructor. Campo explicito.\n\nREGRESION FUNCIONAL corregida (cash.service.ts):\nAl migrar pdfUtils afirme que ningun consumidor usaba la ruta devuelta por\ndownloadPDF y la cambie a boolean. Era falso: cash.service la guarda en el\nstore de descargas para que DownloadsPanel pueda revelar el archivo en el\nexplorador.\n\nFileSystemPort.saveFile ahora devuelve SaveFileResult { saved, path } en vez de\nboolean. Colapsarlo en `string | null` no servia: en web una descarga exitosa\nno tiene ruta, y se habria leido como cancelada. downloadPDF propaga el\nresultado completo; saveExcelFile sigue devolviendo boolean porque se audito\nque todos sus consumidores solo usan truthiness.\n\nVerificacion (esta vez real):\n- npx tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.app.json: 129 errores, TODOS preexistentes.\n  Diff por archivo contra el repo original: cero errores introducidos.\n- eslint: 605 problemas vs 616 del original; ninguno nuevo.\n- vite build: exitoso.","tree":{"sha":"41f27d55c79c593b582128cc857a656e07f32375","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/41f27d55c79c593b582128cc857a656e07f32375"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/49fa407cb217c4f2fa0913c41749061653b4983e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/49fa407cb217c4f2fa0913c41749061653b4983e","node_id":"C_kwDOPFR1DNoAKDQ5ZmE0MDdjYjIxN2M0ZjJmYTA5MTNjNDE3NDkwNjE2NTNiNDk4M2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/cc02ff44732a15b40ab26472a6de7a4516736b17","sha":"cc02ff44732a15b40ab26472a6de7a4516736b17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/cc02ff44732a15b40ab26472a6de7a4516736b17"}],"sha":"49fa407cb217c4f2fa0913c41749061653b4983e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/49fa407cb217c4f2fa0913c41749061653b4983e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/a07f165c0d9439019aa7478c08dcdab766df33b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:32:10Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:39:09Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"build(web): script de deploy al public/ del backend Laravel\n\nCompila con VITE_API_URL relativo (/api/v1 por defecto) y copia el dist al\npublic/ del Laravel. Al quedar servido desde el mismo origen, CORS no\ninterviene.\n\nLimpia public/assets antes de copiar: los nombres llevan hash y sin limpiar se\nacumulan los bundles de cada deploy.\n\nUso: npm run deploy:web [ruta-al-laravel]  (por defecto ../api-commerce)","tree":{"sha":"52541f1da1d994f3b79ea67b2cd6751141fca9d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/52541f1da1d994f3b79ea67b2cd6751141fca9d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/a07f165c0d9439019aa7478c08dcdab766df33b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/a07f165c0d9439019aa7478c08dcdab766df33b9","node_id":"C_kwDOPFR1DNoAKGEwN2YxNjVjMGQ5NDM5MDE5YWE3NDc4YzA4ZGNkYWI3NjZkZjMzYjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/4ea9bceddf4cca780f4e556391ee7a6a1afbcd0e","sha":"4ea9bceddf4cca780f4e556391ee7a6a1afbcd0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/4ea9bceddf4cca780f4e556391ee7a6a1afbcd0e"}],"sha":"a07f165c0d9439019aa7478c08dcdab766df33b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/a07f165c0d9439019aa7478c08dcdab766df33b9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/cc02ff44732a15b40ab26472a6de7a4516736b17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T04:25:33Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:39:09Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"feat(platform): migrar DebugLogWindow y documentar la capa de puertos\n\nOctavo y ultimo slice de la tanda.\n\nLoggerPort: se reemplazo readRecentLogs(): LogEntry[] por readLogText(): string\ny se agrego getLogLocation(). El Panel de Debug trabaja con texto plano —el\narchivo ya es texto y el panel filtra por linea—, asi que estructurar las\nentradas para volver a aplanarlas no agregaba nada. Todavia no lo consumia\nnadie, el cambio de contrato fue gratis.\n\n- adapters/tauri: lee y trunca app.log en BaseDirectory.AppLog, y expone la\n  ruta con appLogDir(). El \"archivo no existe\" (todavia no se escribio ningun\n  log) se traduce a cadena vacia en vez de propagarse como error.\n- adapters/web: formatea el buffer en memoria con el mismo formato de linea que\n  el archivo, para que el panel se comporte igual en ambos targets.\n  getLogLocation() devuelve null y la UI muestra \"En memoria\".\n\nDebugLogWindow: cargar, limpiar y descargar logs pasan por los puertos.\n\nSe agrego src/platform/README.md con el indice de los 11 puertos y las 4 reglas\nde la capa: resolucion sincrona obligatoria, capacidad ausente como booleano,\nel puerto va donde esta la intencion, y los tipos del host no se filtran.\n\nRESULTADO DE LA TANDA: cero imports de @tauri-apps en el codigo de negocio.\nLo unico que queda fuera de src/platform/ es database/db.ts, que por diseno\nsolo importan los dos adaptadores tauri, mas dos comentarios.\n\ntsc --noEmit limpio. eslint identico al baseline del repo original.","tree":{"sha":"14528d2c0e73c5500e00aacc0a95b5bd4f363bdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/14528d2c0e73c5500e00aacc0a95b5bd4f363bdc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/cc02ff44732a15b40ab26472a6de7a4516736b17","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/cc02ff44732a15b40ab26472a6de7a4516736b17","node_id":"C_kwDOPFR1DNoAKGNjMDJmZjQ0NzMyYTE1YjQwYWIyNjQ3MmE2ZGU3YTQ1MTY3MzZiMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/0e4480841bf984a303d9a40dc4ee9afc2c0982ff","sha":"0e4480841bf984a303d9a40dc4ee9afc2c0982ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/0e4480841bf984a303d9a40dc4ee9afc2c0982ff"}],"sha":"cc02ff44732a15b40ab26472a6de7a4516736b17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/cc02ff44732a15b40ab26472a6de7a4516736b17"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/4ea9bceddf4cca780f4e556391ee7a6a1afbcd0e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:08:04Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:39:09Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"test(platform): cubrir los adaptadores web restantes y corregir 2 bugs\n\nDe 50 a 71 tests. Faltaban 6 de los 11 puertos: http, logger, appUpdater,\nwindowChrome y clipboard.\n\nLos tests encontraron DOS bugs reales en mis propios adaptadores:\n\n1. windowChrome.isMaximized() usaba `document.fullscreenElement !== null`.\n   Donde esa propiedad viene `undefined` —entornos que no implementan la API\n   completa— la comparacion estricta da `true` y reporta maximizado sin\n   estarlo. Ahora usa truthiness. Mismo arreglo en onMaximizeChange.\n\n2. El logger web capturaba console.debug/info/warn/error en un Record AL CARGAR\n   EL MODULO. Eso lo dejaba inmune a cualquier parche posterior de `console`\n   (una herramienta de monitoreo, por ejemplo) y ademas lo volvia intesteable.\n   Ahora resuelve el metodo en cada escritura.\n\nEl segundo salio porque el test fallaba: en vez de acomodar el test al codigo,\nse arreglo el codigo. Un mock que no puede interceptar tu logger es una senal,\nno una molestia.\n\nCobertura agregada:\n- http: blob devuelto, credentials omit, HTTP no-2xx, y que el mensaje de error\n  mencione CORS (la diferencia real con el target escritorio, que sale por Rust\n  y lo bypasea).\n- capabilities: los booleanos de capacidad ausente (supportsSelfUpdate,\n  hasCustomChrome, canReadImage) y que las operaciones degraden sin lanzar. Si\n  alguien \"arregla\" un no-op haciendolo lanzar, estos tests fallan.\n- clipboard: normalizacion a data URL, items que no son imagen, permiso\n  denegado.\n- logger: mapeo de nivel a metodo de consola, con trace -> debug porque\n  console.trace imprime el stack entero en cada linea.\n\n71/71. typecheck 124 (todos preexistentes). eslint limpio en src/platform.","tree":{"sha":"cc4247d0f72a67d5dc7bff3ef7f291c7a29e6abf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/cc4247d0f72a67d5dc7bff3ef7f291c7a29e6abf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/4ea9bceddf4cca780f4e556391ee7a6a1afbcd0e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/4ea9bceddf4cca780f4e556391ee7a6a1afbcd0e","node_id":"C_kwDOPFR1DNoAKDRlYTliY2VkZGY0Y2NhNzgwZjRlNTU2MzkxZWU3YTZhMWFmYmNkMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/8f873faa4148612b41b5fa85d4f71212bc26878f","sha":"8f873faa4148612b41b5fa85d4f71212bc26878f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/8f873faa4148612b41b5fa85d4f71212bc26878f"}],"sha":"4ea9bceddf4cca780f4e556391ee7a6a1afbcd0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/4ea9bceddf4cca780f4e556391ee7a6a1afbcd0e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/0e4480841bf984a303d9a40dc4ee9afc2c0982ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T04:23:05Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:39:09Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"feat(platform): puertos ImageProcessor y Clipboard\n\nSeptimo slice. Aisla los tres invoke() a comandos Rust que quedaban en el\ncodigo de negocio.\n\n- ports/imageProcessor.ts: getImageInfo, compressToWebP.\n  adapters/tauri: comandos Rust get_image_info y compress_image_to_webp\n  (libwebp-sys). adapters/web: canvas.toDataURL(''image/webp'', q), que el\n  navegador soporta de forma nativa. Es de las pocas piezas de Rust del\n  proyecto que el navegador reemplaza SIN perder capacidad; la unica opcion sin\n  equivalente es `effort`, que el navegador ignora.\n  El adaptador web falla explicito si toDataURL cae a PNG (navegador sin WebP)\n  en vez de devolver algo que no es lo pedido.\n\n- ports/clipboard.ts: canReadImage, readImage.\n  adapters/tauri: comando read_clipboard_image (arboard). El comando devuelve\n  base64 CRUDO, asi que el adaptador lo normaliza a data URL para que los\n  consumidores reciban lo mismo en ambos targets.\n  adapters/web: Async Clipboard API.\n\nMigrados:\n- utils/imageCompression.ts (getImageInfo + las dos compresiones).\n- components/common/DownloadsPanel.tsx: revealInExplorer pasa por el puerto de\n  archivos y la accion se esconde con canRevealInFolder() en vez de con una\n  comprobacion ad-hoc de isTauriEnvironment().\n- messaging/ChatConversation.tsx: el pegado de imagenes usa el puerto. De paso\n  se simplifico el control de flujo: antes dependia de que el mensaje de error\n  del comando Rust contuviera \"no_image\" para decidir si restaurar el pegado de\n  texto; ahora el puerto devuelve null y el camino queda explicito.\n\ntsc --noEmit limpio. eslint sin errores nuevos (3 problemas en\nChatConversation, identicos al baseline del repo original).","tree":{"sha":"f868fc8e27a8f7438bbd53c90c424e75c3717e63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/f868fc8e27a8f7438bbd53c90c424e75c3717e63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/0e4480841bf984a303d9a40dc4ee9afc2c0982ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"un