ist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/d62b4a0c2c411de1bc120c266d4b4c60a39de442/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T04:19:28Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:39:09Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"feat(platform): puerto WindowChrome para barra de titulo y zoom\n\nSexto slice. Aisla api/window y api/webviewWindow fuera de la capa de ventanas.\n\n- ports/windowChrome.ts: hasCustomChrome, minimize, toggleMaximize, close,\n  isMaximized, onMaximizeChange, startDragging, setZoom.\n- adapters/tauri: getCurrentWindow(), que resuelve la ventana correcta tanto en\n  la principal como en las secundarias.\n- adapters/web: pantalla completa para maximizar, window.close() para cerrar,\n  CSS zoom para el zoom; minimizar y arrastrar son no-op porque el navegador es\n  el dueno del marco.\n\nhasCustomChrome() es la clave: la UI pregunta la capacidad en vez de renderizar\nbotones que no pueden hacer nada.\n\n- TitleBar: en web conserva marca y pestanas, esconde los 3 controles de\n  ventana y desactiva el arrastre.\n- SecondaryTitleBar: en web esconde minimizar y maximizar pero MANTIENE cerrar,\n  porque window.close() si funciona en ventanas abiertas por script.\n- useZoom: se le saco la deteccion ad-hoc de window.__TAURI__ y el fallback\n  duplicado; ahora delega en el puerto.\n\nAmbas barras ya usaban el componente Button compartido; se mantiene.\n\ntsc --noEmit limpio. eslint sin hallazgos (igual que el baseline).","tree":{"sha":"17e8850c6707ee232b9b8cf96d126d996a7c8f08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/17e8850c6707ee232b9b8cf96d126d996a7c8f08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/d62b4a0c2c411de1bc120c266d4b4c60a39de442","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/d62b4a0c2c411de1bc120c266d4b4c60a39de442","node_id":"C_kwDOPFR1DNoAKGQ2MmI0YTBjMmM0MTFkZTFiYzEyMGMyNjZkNGI0YzYwYTM5ZGU0NDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/320926cbe08a17537e3de8cebe92902562ae20d8","sha":"320926cbe08a17537e3de8cebe92902562ae20d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/320926cbe08a17537e3de8cebe92902562ae20d8"}],"sha":"d62b4a0c2c411de1bc120c266d4b4c60a39de442","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/d62b4a0c2c411de1bc120c266d4b4c60a39de442"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/18c32600506847d537d0797181256568769e2a2d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T02:54:19Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:39:09Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"refactor(products): separar el selector de productos de su contenedor\n\nQuinto y ultimo selector agnostico. Es el mas grande: 1309 LOC movidas con\ngit mv. Se dejo para el final a proposito, con el patron ya calibrado en los\notros cuatro.\n\n- components/productSelector/ProductSelector.tsx: la logica.\n- screens/ProductSelectorWindow.tsx: contenedor VENTANA, 87 lineas.\n\nTiene tres salidas, ahora callbacks:\n- onSelectProduct   (seleccion simple)\n- onSelectProducts  (seleccion multiple confirmada, con cantidades)\n- onClose\n\nComo en sales, `windowId` se reemplaza por `instanceId` en el contrato: dentro\ndel componente solo servia para aislar los filtros persistidos. El contenedor\nsigue pasando el windowId, asi que no cambia el comportamiento.\n\nTipos que estaban implicitos y ahora se exportan: ProductSelectorContext y\nProductWithQuantity (ProductGet + quantity), que era el payload real de\nproduct-multi-selected y no estaba tipado en ningun lado.\n\nSe saco config.initialFilters del contrato: estaba declarado en la interfaz,\nnunca se seteaba al leer la URL y nunca se leia en el cuerpo.\n\ntypecheck 125 — diff por archivo contra el original: cero errores introducidos.\neslint 7 problemas vs 8 del original. 50/50 tests. Ambos builds OK.","tree":{"sha":"b93c1f67701f4d740a5f47dfb95d3e054d4dda64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/b93c1f67701f4d740a5f47dfb95d3e054d4dda64"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/18c32600506847d537d0797181256568769e2a2d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/18c32600506847d537d0797181256568769e2a2d","node_id":"C_kwDOPFR1DNoAKDE4YzMyNjAwNTA2ODQ3ZDUzN2QwNzk3MTgxMjU2NTY4NzY5ZTJhMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/28ec486d57a223a3213fc4efd790714d7b9165ac","sha":"28ec486d57a223a3213fc4efd790714d7b9165ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/28ec486d57a223a3213fc4efd790714d7b9165ac"}],"sha":"18c32600506847d537d0797181256568769e2a2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/18c32600506847d537d0797181256568769e2a2d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/320926cbe08a17537e3de8cebe92902562ae20d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T04:16:17Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:39:09Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"feat(platform): puerto AppUpdater y version de app inyectada en build\n\nQuinto slice. Aisla api/app, plugin-updater y plugin-process.\n\n- ports/appUpdater.ts: getCurrentVersion, supportsSelfUpdate, checkForUpdate,\n  downloadAndInstall, relaunch, dismiss.\n- adapters/tauri: plugin-updater contra el endpoint de tauri.conf.json +\n  relanzado del proceso. El handle Update queda DENTRO del adaptador, no se\n  filtra al estado de React como antes.\n- adapters/web: sin autoactualizacion. supportsSelfUpdate() es false,\n  checkForUpdate() devuelve null y relaunch() recarga la pagina.\n\nLa version en web sale de __APP_VERSION__, inyectada por Vite desde\npackage.json (misma fuente de verdad que usa Tauri). Declarada en vite-env.d.ts.\n\nEl puerto expone supportsSelfUpdate() para que la UI esconda la seccion en vez\nde mostrar botones inertes: UpdateSettings ahora renderiza un Alert con la\nversion desplegada cuando el target no se autoactualiza. Usa los componentes\ncompartidos (Alert/AlertTitle/AlertDescription), no HTML crudo.\n\nuseUpdateChecker: se saco Update de UpdateState (ningun consumidor lo usaba) y\nlos callbacks pasan a useCallback para no recrearse en cada render.\n\ntsc --noEmit limpio. eslint sin hallazgos.","tree":{"sha":"f7ec3238677baba9bd8a16f4272c3a53d684ae42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/f7ec3238677baba9bd8a16f4272c3a53d684ae42"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/320926cbe08a17537e3de8cebe92902562ae20d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/u