"organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/28ec486d57a223a3213fc4efd790714d7b9165ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T02:47:20Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:39:09Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"refactor(quotations): separar el selector de cotizaciones de su contenedor\n\nCuarto selector agnostico. 608 LOC movidas con git mv.\n\n- components/quotationSelector/QuotationSelector.tsx: la logica.\n- screens/quotationSelectorWindow.tsx: contenedor VENTANA, 51 lineas.\n\nEl selector carga la cotizacion completa con useQuotationGetById y la entrega\npor onSelectQuotation; el contenedor la emite y cierra. Antes ese useEffect\ndependia de config.windowId y de platformWindows (un singleton que nunca\ncambia); ahora depende solo del callback.\n\nDe paso se agrego el import faltante del tipo QuotationGetById, que el archivo\nusaba de forma implicita a traves del hook.\n\ntypecheck 125 (todos preexistentes). eslint: 1 warning, identico al baseline.","tree":{"sha":"f5004eea153c4981cad704ed5094eaf114033b2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/f5004eea153c4981cad704ed5094eaf114033b2d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/28ec486d57a223a3213fc4efd790714d7b9165ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verifie