d}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/ba84dda2c63689b87ebda0b22cfd11fdb725bbcd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T04:12:45Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:39:09Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"feat(platform): puertos Logger, KeybindingsRepository y PreferencesRepository\n\nCuarto slice. Aisla plugin-log y deja plugin-sql accesible solo desde los\nadaptadores tauri.\n\nLogger:\n- ports/logger.ts: write + readRecentLogs + clearLogs.\n- adapters/tauri: archivo de log de la app via plugin-log.\n- adapters/web: buffer circular en memoria (2000 entradas). No escribe a\n  console porque los consumidores ya lo hacen; duplicarlo ensucia DevTools.\n- Migrados utils/logger.ts y lib/logger.ts (este ultimo usaba invoke() a los\n  comandos Rust log_info/log_error/log_warn/log_debug).\n\nRepositorios de dominio (keybindings y preferences):\n- El navegador NO tiene motor SQL. Un SqlPort seria una abstraccion falsa: no\n  se puede implementar sin cargar ~1 MB de WASM para persistir un punado de\n  atajos. Cuando los targets difieren en CAPACIDAD y no solo en API, el puerto\n  va donde esta la intencion, no donde esta la tecnologia.\n- adapters/tauri: las MISMAS sentencias sobre sqlite:app.db. Cero migracion de\n  datos para los usuarios que ya tienen atajos y preferencias guardados.\n- adapters/web: un documento por repositorio sobre el puerto de clave/valor.\n- Migrados keybindings/store/persistence.ts, database/schemas/keybindings.schema.ts\n  y database/schemas/preferences.schema.ts.\n\ndatabase/db.ts queda como detalle de implementacion del target escritorio:\nya solo lo importan los dos adaptadores tauri.\n\ntsc --noEmit limpio. eslint sin errores nuevos (8 problemas, identicos al\nbaseline del repo original).","tree":{"sha":"768c1f3ebf23206e7dd88cc0e15d6a3e558898f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/768c1f3ebf23206e7dd88cc0e15d6a3e558898f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/ba84dda2c63689b87ebda0b22cfd11fdb725bbcd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/ba84dda2c63689b87ebda0b22cfd11fdb725bbcd","node_id":"C_kwDOPFR1DNoAKGJhODRkZGEyYzYzNjg5Yjg3ZWJkYTBiMjJjZmQxMWZkYjcyNWJiY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/b1b8aed1dc9449b7c9070c878cc23ebaa40a67da","sha":"b1b8aed1dc9449b7c9070c878cc23ebaa40a67da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/b1b8aed1dc9449b7c9070c878cc23ebaa40a67da"}],"sha":"ba84dda2c63689b87ebda0b22cfd11fdb725bbcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/ba84dda2c63689b87ebda0b22cfd11fdb725bbcd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/a79ef370a9a0724da46b6a4966f3c4f2c261384a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T02:41:05Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:39:09Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"refactor(sales): separar el selector de detalles de venta de su contenedor\n\nTercer selector agnostico. 601 LOC movidas con git mv para conservar historia.\n\n- components/saleDetailSelector/SaleDetailSelector.tsx: la logica.\n- screens/SaleDetailSelectorWindow.tsx: contenedor VENTANA, 74 lineas.\n\nCambio de contrato: el componente ya no recibe `windowId` sino `instanceId`.\nEse id se usaba para UNA sola cosa —aislar los filtros persistidos entre\nselectores abiertos a la vez— y eso no es transporte. El contenedor ventana\nsigue pasando el windowId como instanceId, asi que el comportamiento no cambia.\n\nLos dos puntos de salida pasan a callbacks: onChangesApplied y onClose. El\ncontenedor los traduce a emitToWindow + closeCurrentWindow.\n\nDe paso, el useCallback de confirmAndClose dejo de depender de platformWindows\n(un singleton que no cambia) y del windowId.\n\ntypecheck 125 (todos preexistentes). eslint: 6 problemas, identicos a los que\ntenia el archivo original — viajaron con el codigo, no se introdujo ninguno.","tree":{"sha":"afafbbdabd6d6d787bb10b4524907bdb7b310b7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/afafbbdabd6d6d787bb10b4524907bdb7b310b7b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/a79ef370a9a0724da46b6a4966f3c4f2c261384a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/a79ef370a9a0724da46b6a4966f3c4f2c261384a","node_id":"C_kwDOPFR1DNoAKGE3OWVmMzcwYTlhMDcyNGRhNDZiNmE0OTY2ZjNjNGYyYzI2MTM4NGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/100a408fe30ac368c41b228b9b94a226d8271c65","sha":"100a408fe30ac368c41b228b9b94a226d8271c65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/100a408fe30ac368c41b228b9b94a226d8271c65"}],"sha":"a79ef370a9a0724da46b6a4966f3c4f2c261384a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/a79ef370a9a0724da46b6a4966f3c4f2c261384a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/b1b8aed1dc9449b7c9070c878cc23ebaa40a67da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T04:05:23Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:39:09Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"feat(platform): puertos FileSystem y Http para exportaciones y descargas\n\nTercer slice. Aisla plugin-fs, plugin-dialog, plugin-shell, api/path y\nplugin-http detras de dos puertos.\n\n- ports/fileSystem.ts: saveFile, pickTextFile, openExternal, openBlob,\n  canRevealInFolder, revealInFolder. Modela lo que la app realmente hace\n  (entregar bytes al usuario), no un sistema de archivos completo.\n- ports/http.ts: fetchBlob para binarios desde una URL.\n- adapters/tauri: dialogos nativos + plugin-fs + shell.open + temp dir.\n- adapters/web: <a download>, <input type=file>, window.open.\n\nDecision: el adaptador web NO usa showSaveFilePicker. Esa API exige activacion\ntransitoria del usuario, que se vence durante el trabajo asincrono previo a\nguardar (generar el Excel, armar el PDF, bajar el blob). <a download> no la\nnecesita y funciona siempre; se pierde el dialogo \"Guardar como\" a cambio de que\nla descarga nunca falle.\n\nopenBlob en web degrada a descarga si el navegador bloquea la pestana, en vez\nde fallar en silencio.\n\nMigrados: fileUtils, excelUtils, imageUtils, pdfUtils, imageCompression\n(fetchImageAsBlobUrl) y KeybindingsSettings (export/import de atajos).\n\nimageUtils ya no lanza \"Not in Tauri environment\": el puerto resuelve web.\nsaveExcelFile y downloadPDF pasan de devolver la ruta a devolver boolean;\nningun consumidor usaba la ruta, solo truthiness.\n\nenvironment.ts ahora delega isTauriEnvironment en platform/env para tener UNA\nsola deteccion (la de platform tambien chequea __TAURI_INTERNALS__).\n\ntsc --noEmit limpio. eslint sin hallazgos en la capa nueva ni en los migrados.","tree":{"sha":"23e73149b4fcac7dc90a56088427a2d48413d027","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/23e73149b4fcac7dc90a56088427a2d48413d027"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/b1b8aed1dc9449b7c9070c878cc23ebaa40a67da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/b1b8aed1dc9449b7c9070c878cc23ebaa40a67da","node_id":"C_kwDOPFR1DNoAKGIxYjhhZWQxZGM5NDQ5YjdjOTA3MGM4NzhjYzIzZWJhYTQwYTY3ZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/b0348febc79573d07d391f9f9ba89e3ae4a77a04","sha":"b0348febc79573d07d391f9f9ba89e3ae4a77a04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/b0348febc79573d07d391f9f9ba89e3ae4a77a04"}],"sha":"b1b8aed1dc9449b7c9070c878cc23ebaa40a67da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/b1b8aed1dc9449b7c9070c878cc23ebaa40a67da"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/100a408fe30ac368c41b228b9b94a226d8271c65/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T02:38:14Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:39:09Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"refactor(purchases): separar el selector de compras de su contenedor\n\nSegundo selector agnostico, mismo patron que orders.\n\n- components/purchaseSelector/PurchaseSelector.tsx: la logica. Recibe config\n  por props, avisa con onSelectPurchase y onClose. h-full en vez de h-screen.\n- screens/PurchaseSelectorWindow.tsx: contenedor VENTANA. 311 -> 51 lineas.\n\nArreglos de paso (bugs preexistentes, verificados en el repo original):\n\n1. El className del proveedor estaba mangleado por un find/replace:\n     className={`$${\"{\"} !proveedor ? ''...'' : ''...'' ${\"}\"}`}\n   Eso evaluaba a la CADENA LITERAL \"${ !proveedor ? ... }\", asi que Tailwind\n   recibia basura y el nombre del proveedor nunca tomo su estilo. Ahora es una\n   expresion normal.\n\n2. El useMemo de las columnas dependia de handleSelectPurchase, que se recreaba\n   en cada render: el memo no servia de nada. Ahora depende de un callback\n   estable.\n\n3. `bg-white` hardcodeado -> `bg-background`, y `text-gray-600` /\n   `border-gray-200` -> tokens del tema. En modo oscuro la ventana quedaba con\n   fondo blanco.\n\n4. config.onlyWithStock se leia de la URL y no se usaba en ningun lado. Se saco\n   del contrato del componente agnostico, que debe declarar solo lo que usa.\n\ntypecheck 125 (todos preexistentes), eslint limpio en los archivos tocados.","tree":{"sha":"b3cbca2574bceed3beadbd4bca9b227be3a2e16a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/b3cbca2574bceed3beadbd4bca9b227be3a2e16a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/100a408fe30ac368c41b228b9b94a226d8271c65","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/100a408fe30ac368c41b228b9b94a226d8271c65","node_id":"C_kwDOPFR1DNoAKDEwMGE0MDhmZTMwYWMzNjhjNDFiMjI4YjliOTRhMjI2ZDgyNzFjNjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/cdf22923d44b7e70df17ecca9152366cd52bbe7e","sha":"cdf22923d44b7e70df17ecca9152366cd52bbe7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/cdf22923d44b7e70df17ecca9152366cd52bbe7e"}],"sha":"100a408fe30ac368c41b228b9b94a226d8271c65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/100a408fe30ac368c41b228b9b94a226d8271c65"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/b0348febc79573d07d391f9f9ba89e3ae4a77a04/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T03:56:14Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:39:09Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"feat(platform): puerto KeyValueStore para persistencia clave/valor\n\nSegundo puerto de la capa de plataforma. Aisla @tauri-apps/plugin-store, que\nera el ultimo acoplamiento en los stores de la app.\n\n- ports/keyValueStore.ts: store con nombre (get/set/delete/clear/entries/save),\n  la superficie exacta que los consumidores ya usaban.\n- adapters/tauri: un archivo JSON por store, cacheado por nombre.\n- adapters/web: claves con prefijo tps:<store>: en localStorage, con respaldo en\n  memoria si el almacenamiento esta bloqueado (navegacion privada) y descarte de\n  valores corruptos en vez de romper el arranque.\n\nMigrados:\n- tauriPluginAdapterStore.ts -> platformStateStorage.ts (puente con el\n  middleware persist de zustand; themeStore y appearanceStore rewireados).\n- viewConfigStore.ts\n- messaging/OfflineQueueStore.ts\n\nLimite documentado: localStorage ronda 5 MB por origen. Si la cola offline\ncrece, el reemplazo es IndexedDB detras del MISMO puerto, sin tocar consumidores.\n\ntsc --noEmit limpio. eslint sin errores nuevos.","tree":{"sha":"be30dbf3bcf66e336be8b0a5e0db1357eefea4aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/be30dbf3bcf66e336be8b0a5e0db1357eefea4aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/b0348febc79573d07d391f9f9ba89e3ae4a77a04","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/b0348febc79573d07d391f9f9ba89e3ae4a77a04","node_id":"C_kwDOPFR1DNoAKGIwMzQ4ZmViYzc5NTczZDA3ZDM5MWY5ZjliYTg5ZTNhZTRhNzdhMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/772f2e2db20fb5af803acb90a667ad7da0309a58","sha":"772f2e2db20fb5af803acb90a667ad7da0309a58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/772f2e2db20fb5af803acb90a667ad7da0309a58"}],"sha":"b0348febc79573d07d391f9f9ba89e3ae4a77a04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/b0348febc79573d07d391f9f9ba89e3ae4a77a04"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/cdf22923d44b7e70df17ecca9152366cd52bbe7e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T02:05:21Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:39:09Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"refactor(orders): separar el selector de pedidos de su contenedor\n\nPrimer selector agnostico al contenedor. Se eligio el mas chico (224 LOC) para\ncalibrar el patron antes de tocar ProductSelectorWindow, que tiene 1309.\n\nEl acoplamiento al contenedor eran dos cosas: leer la config de la URL y emitir\nla seleccion con emitToWindow. Ahora quedan separadas:\n\n- components/orderSelector/OrderSelector.tsx: la logica de seleccion. Recibe\n  `config` por props y avisa con `onSelectOrder`. No sabe si vive en una ventana\n  del SO o en un dialogo. Usa h-full en vez de h-screen: el alto lo decide el\n  contenedor.\n- screens/OrderSelectorWindow.tsx: contenedor VENTANA. Solo transporte — lee la\n  URL y devuelve la seleccion por el puerto antes de cerrarse. Paso de 224 a 48\n  lineas.\n- constants/orderStatus.ts: ORDER_STATUS_MAP y DEFAULT_ORDER_STATUS. Exportar\n  constantes desde un archivo de componentes rompe el fast refresh.\n\nComponentes compartidos nuevos (antes no existian y cada pantalla improvisaba):\n\n- common/ErrorBoundary.tsx: limite de errores reutilizable. Reemplaza la clase\n  que OrderSelectorWindow definia inline con markup crudo; el fallback usa\n  Alert/Button compartidos, asi respeta tema y tipografia, y agrega Reintentar.\n- common/SelectorDialog.tsx: contenedor DIALOGO para montar cualquier selector\n  dentro de la pagina. Es el gemelo de la ventana secundaria y la pieza que\n  habilita decidir ventanas vs dialogos por target sin tocar la logica.\n\ntypecheck 125 (todos preexistentes), eslint limpio en los archivos tocados,\n50/50 tests, build:web OK.","tree":{"sha":"e47b23431ef2702a21f164c69a0b8e341bbccf51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/e47b23431ef2702a21f164c69a0b8e341bbccf51"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/cdf22923d44b7e70df17ecca9152366cd52bbe7e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/cdf22923d44b7e70df17ecca9152366cd52bbe7e","node_id":"C_kwDOPFR1DNoAKGNkZjIyOTIzZDQ0YjdlNzBkZjE3ZWNjYTkxNTIzNjZjZDUyYmJlN2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/5df72044f4b5bbbff52b98175ba807fc550cf913","sha":"5df72044f4b5bbbff52b98175ba807fc550cf913","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/5df72044f4b5bbbff52b98175ba807fc550cf913"}],"sha":"cdf22923d44b7e70df17ecca9152366cd52bbe7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/cdf22923d44b7e70df17ecca9152366cd52bbe7e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/772f2e2db20fb5af803acb90a667ad7da0309a58/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T03:49:24Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:39:09Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"feat(platform): capa de puertos con WindowManager para targets tauri y web\n\nIntroduce src/platform como frontera entre el codigo de negocio y el host de\nejecucion. El negocio ya no importa @tauri-apps para manejar ventanas.\n\n- ports/windowManager.ts: contrato neutral (crear, cerrar, enfocar, eventos\n  dirigidos, canal global, contexto de la ventana actual).\n- adapters/tauri: traslado literal de utils/tauriWindows.ts, preservando la\n  logica anti-zombie (destruir -> esperar -> recrear, recuperacion del falso\n  positivo \"already exists\", timeout de seguridad).\n- adapters/web: window.open + BroadcastChannel + beforeunload.\n- index.ts: resolucion SINCRONA y cacheada del adaptador activo.\n\nEl resolvedor y los adaptadores se importan estaticamente a proposito:\nwindow.open() solo se permite dentro del gesto del usuario y cualquier await\nprevio hace que el navegador bloquee el popup en silencio. Un import dinamico\nvolveria asincrona la resolucion y romperia el target web.\n\nMigrados: useSecondaryWindow, useCloseSecondaryWindowsOnExit, useRouteViewConfig,\nmain.tsx, window-entry.tsx y los 5 selectores de ventana secundaria.\n\nWebviewWindow ya no se filtra a los hooks: se reemplaza por SecondaryWindowHandle\n(ningun consumidor usaba el handle mas alla de cerrar/enfocar).\n\nuseCloseSecondaryWindowsOnExit pasa a handler sincrono con cierre\nfire-and-forget: el handler async bloqueaba el cierre en Tauri v2, causa raiz\nde las ventanas zombie ya documentada en window-entry.tsx y main.tsx.\n\ntsc --noEmit limpio. eslint sin errores nuevos (src/platform sin hallazgos).","tree":{"sha":"4e198a8678d530e50b4b9a041bff3f81ce8c77f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/4e198a8678d530e50b4b9a041bff3f81ce8c77f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/772f2e2db20fb5af803acb90a667ad7da0309a58","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git