","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/5df72044f4b5bbbff52b98175ba807fc550cf913/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T01:25:45Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:39:09Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"docs(platform): documentar seleccion de adaptadores en build y corregir desactualizados","tree":{"sha":"e14a73a1038d484906c951ac0c3ff78ff4285358","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/e14a73a1038d484906c951ac0c3ff78ff4285358"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/5df72044f4b5bbbff52b98175ba807fc550cf913","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/5df72044f4b5bbbff52b98175ba807fc550cf913","node_id":"C_kwDOPFR1DNoAKDVkZjcyMDQ0ZjRiNWJiYmZmNTJiOTgxNzViYTgwN2ZjNTUwY2Y5MTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/cbda0c6466b30ac630f7e341d3960535b08ba702","sha":"cbda0c6466b30ac630f7e341d3960535b08ba702","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/cbda0c6466b30ac630f7e341d3960535b08ba702"}],"sha":"5df72044f4b5bbbff52b98175ba807fc550cf913","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/5df72044f4b5bbbff52b98175ba807fc550cf913"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/cbda0c6466b30ac630f7e341d3960535b08ba702/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T01:24:02Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:39:09Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"build: seleccionar adaptadores por target en tiempo de build\n\nUn solo codebase, dos artefactos. El bundle de cada target deja de contener el\ncodigo del otro.\n\n- adapters/tauri/index.ts y adapters/web/index.ts: barrels con nombres\n  canonicos (windowManager, fileSystem, ...). Cada export esta anotado con el\n  tipo de su puerto, asi una desincronizacion la detecta tsc en el barrel y no\n  en runtime dentro del target que nadie esta probando.\n- vite.config.ts: alias ''@platform-adapters'' resuelto por BUILD_TARGET. Sin la\n  variable resuelve a ''tauri'', para que `npm run dev` y `npm run build` —los\n  que invoca tauri.conf.json— sigan funcionando sin tocar nada.\n- platform/index.ts: importa del alias. Los get*() siguen siendo sincronos, que\n  es lo que exige la regla del gesto del usuario.\n- Chequeo de coherencia solo en DEV: si el target compilado no coincide con el\n  host real, avisa por consola con el comando correcto en vez de reventar mas\n  tarde con un error criptico adentro de @tauri-apps.\n- vitest.config.ts apunta al barrel web (los tests corren en happy-dom).\n- tsconfig.app.json mapea el alias para que TS lo resuelva.\n\nScripts nuevos: dev:web, build:web, preview:web.\n\nMEDICIONES\n\nBundle web sin el alias:  4760,29 KB\nBundle web con el alias:  4721,58 KB   (-38,7 KB)\nBundle escritorio:        4750,33 KB\n\nRastros de Tauri en el bundle web: solo la funcion isTauri(), que es una\ncomparacion de strings de ~80 bytes. Cero codigo de @tauri-apps: no hay\ntransformCallback, ni invoke(\"plugin:, ni ipc.localhost.\n\nEsto es lo que motivo el cambio: la preocupacion era \"cargar todo al desplegar\nla web\". El costo real de tener los dos targets juntos eran 38,7 KB sobre 4,7\nMB (0,78%), y ahora es cero, sin duplicar las 176.902 lineas de dominio.\n\nnpm test 50/50. typecheck 125 errores, todos preexistentes.","tree":{"sha":"2aa525beb688c05c804f56dfbfecb3a04cc4e37a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/2aa525beb688c05c804f56dfbfecb3a04cc4e37a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/cbda0c6466b30ac630f7e341d3960535b08ba702","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/cbda0c6466b30ac630f7e341d3960535b08ba702","node_id":"C_kwDOPFR1DNoAKGNiZGEwYzY0NjZiMzBhYzYzMGY3ZTM0MWQzOTYwNTM1YjA4YmE3MDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/63527de064f69c4c7ac692cb8cc91e823b8e7195","sha":"63527de064f69c4c7ac692cb8cc91e823b8e7195","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/63527de064f69c4c7ac692cb8cc91e823b8e7195"}],"sha":"cbda0c6466b30ac630f7e341d3960535b08ba702","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/cbda0c6466b30ac630f7e341d3960535b08ba702"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/63527de064f69c4c7ac692cb8cc91e823b8e7195/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T01:00:08Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:39:09Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"test(platform): montar Vitest y cubrir los adaptadores web\n\nReemplaza la red de seguridad que faltaba. 50 tests en 5 archivos, 1s de\nejecucion.\n\nInfra:\n- vitest + happy-dom (los adaptadores son logica pura; no hace falta\n  testing-library todavia).\n- vitest.config.ts separado de vite.config.ts: los tests no necesitan el plugin\n  de React ni Tailwind y arrancan mas rapido sin ellos.\n- Scripts: `test`, `test:watch`.\n- `typecheck` ahora es `tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.app.json`. El tsconfig raiz es\n  solution-style y `tsc --noEmit` a secas no compila NADA (fue lo que oculto 8\n  errores). El script `build` sigue con el defecto: se deja para decidir aparte.\n\nCobertura:\n- windowManager: el test central verifica que window.open se llama de forma\n  SINCRONA, antes del primer await. Verificado por mutacion: agregar un\n  `await Promise.resolve()` antes de la llamada hace fallar exactamente ese\n  test. Ademas: popup bloqueado, URL y query params, cache-buster para contexto\n  fresco, ausencia de noopener, ciclo de vida, ruteo de eventos por ventana,\n  despacho local del broadcast y aviso global de closeAllSecondary.\n- keyValueStore: tipos preservados, aislamiento entre stores, misma instancia\n  por nombre, defaults que no pisan lo guardado, descarte de valores corruptos.\n- keybindings/preferences repositories: upsert que preserva `enabled`,\n  getEnabled filtrando y ordenando como el SQL original, persistencia real en\n  localStorage.\n- fileSystem: saved/path separados (la regresion de cash.service), degradacion\n  de openBlob a descarga si bloquean la pestana, capacidades ausentes.\n- env: deteccion por __TAURI_INTERNALS__ y por __TAURI__.\n\nnpm test: 50/50. typecheck: 125 errores, todos preexistentes; diff por archivo\ncontra el original sin ninguno introducido.","tree":{"sha":"97c09fe37f463f1370dca29167472b3cef88a4fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/97c09fe37f463f1370dca29167472b3cef88a4fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/63527de064f69c4c7ac692cb8cc91e823b8e7195","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/63527de064f69c4c7ac692cb8cc91e823b8e7195","node_id":"C_kwDOPFR1DNoAKDYzNTI3ZGUwNjRmNjljNGM3YWM2OTJjYjhjYzkxZTgyM2I4ZTcxOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/98b13f20ddff5ec9cbeaf30f44aef76688183452","sha":"98b13f20ddff5ec9cbeaf30f44aef76688183452","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/98b13f20ddff5ec9cbeaf30f44aef76688183452"}],"sha":"63527de064f69c4c7ac692cb8cc91e823b8e7195","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/63527de064f69c4c7ac692cb8cc91e823b8e7195"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/98b13f20ddff5ec9cbeaf30f44aef76688183452/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T00:50:28Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:39:09Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"refactor: eliminar el visor de logs y dejar LoggerPort solo de escritura\n\nEl Panel de Debug ya no se va a usar. Se elimina la feature completa, no las\nllamadas de logging: los ~570 Logger.*/logger.* repartidos en 55 archivos\nsiguen intactos porque no cuestan nada y son el diagnostico de la app.\n\nEliminados:\n- components/common/DebugLogWindow.tsx\n- components/common/DebugPanel.tsx (era codigo comentado)\n- components/common/LogLine.tsx\n- utils/logFormatter.ts (solo lo usaba el visor)\n- useDebugLogWindow y su registro como ventana secundaria \"debug-log\"\n- Los atajos Ctrl+Shift+D y F12 de main.tsx\n\nLoggerPort queda solo con write(): se sacaron canReadLogs, readLogText,\ngetLogLocation y clearLogs. Nadie leia los logs desde la app, y el buffer en\nmemoria del adaptador web era complejidad por una funcion sin uso.\n\nEl adaptador web ahora escribe a console (antes acumulaba en memoria sin\nescribir); el de escritorio sigue yendo al archivo de la app, que es lo util\npara soporte.\n\nwindow-entry: NO_AUTH_COMPONENTS queda vacio, \"debug-log\" era el unico\ncomponente que se montaba sin sesion.\n\ntsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.app.json: 126 errores, todos preexistentes. Diff por\narchivo contra el original: cero introducidos.","tree":{"sha":"1bdedb915bb93ef718f28c18b22aec5ce0f13ac4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/1bdedb915bb93ef718f28c18b22aec5ce0f13ac4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/98b13f20ddff5ec9cbeaf30f44aef76688183452","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.gith