it/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commits/bcbbcbe4dd4bfbfeb4d0548157dd14a583de663b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T17:54:02Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T17:54:02Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"feat(order-cart): carrito de pedido desde el listado de productos\n\nPermite marcar faltantes con un gesto desde el menu de acciones del listado\nde productos, acumularlos en un carrito personal y sembrarlos en la creacion\nde pedido sin volver a buscar cada producto.\n\n- Store Zustand nuevo y aislado en src/modules/orderCart, llaveado por id de\n  usuario mas sucursal y persistido en localStorage. No reutiliza el carrito\n  de ventas: su validacion se apoya en tener stock y un pedido es lo inverso.\n- El scope se resuelve dentro del hook y no por argumentos, y es reactivo a\n  onAuthStateChanged para cubrir la hidratacion async del SDK de auth. Sin\n  usuario o sin sucursal cae a un carrito nulo que no persiste.\n- El traspaso mapea la cantidad de forma explicita y vacia el carrito por el\n  subconjunto elegido, no por el retorno de addMultipleProducts, que solo\n  incluye los detalles nuevos y omite los que se mergean.\n- La seleccion producto por producto queda detras del flag\n  seedFromOrderCartSelective, apagado: el flujo normal trae todo de un click.\n- Todo el cambio es de frontend. No toca el contrato de creacion de pedido.","tree":{"sha":"65defff4df59f52e05729dcf2302ada3b4223a69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/65defff4df59f52e05729dcf2302ada3b4223a69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/bcbbcbe4dd4bfbfeb4d0548157dd14a583de663b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/commit/bcbbcbe4dd4bfbfeb4d0548157dd14a583de663b","node_id":"C_kwDOPFR1DNoAKGJjYmJjYmU0ZGQ0YmZiZmViNGQwNTQ4MTU3ZGQxNGE1ODNkZTY2M2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/StackOverlords/T