":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"feat(products): edición inline de precios por lote en el detalle de producto\n\nLas columnas Precio Venta y Precio Venta Alt. de las tablas de stock del modal\nde detalle ahora son editables inline (borrador local + botón Guardar/Cancelar),\npara corregir lotes afectados por precios incorrectos sin abrir el modal aparte.\n\n- useStockPriceDrafts: borrador local, guarda solo al confirmar (evita guardados\n  por blur), un lote = una llamada a update_prices (detalles:[id]). El costo no\n  se toca, solo es base del incremento.\n- Celdas modificadas se resaltan; botón Guardar (N) en el header.\n- Edición y botón del modal gateados por permiso com-update_prices (antes estaba\n  sin guard en el frontend).","tree":{"sha":"389a5e6272df5020eea33e11655f6f0cdf841eb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/389a5e6272df5020eea33e11655f6f0cdf841eb5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/82bddf2eac5e6614942cb202c0831b9550c733f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions