me":"olivio-git"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T03:34:52Z","email":"subelzaolivitocabezas@gmail.com","name":"olivio-git"},"message":"fix(transfers): tomar precio de venta del lote y no del maestro del producto\n\nAl crear una transferencia el precio de venta se tomaba de product.precio_venta\n(precio maestro del producto), ignorando el precio_venta real de cada lote. Esto\nprovocaba que un lote transferido llegara con un precio distinto al editado por\nlote (ej: 489,50 en vez de 385,15).\n\nAhora getTransferDetails pisa precio_salida/precio_entrada_venta/precio_entrada_venta_alt\ncon el precio de cada lote al partir FIFO, igual que ya hacía con costo y TC. La\nsemilla en addProduct y el prefill de import tambien usan el lote.","tree":{"sha":"bcb58ed058fec11e58291080cffe79f7696e6def","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/trees/bcb58ed058fec11e58291080cffe79f7696e6def"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/StackOverlords/TPS_INTERMOTORS/git/commits/b9a61b174f283d7a36d5efb9a506c7e8473c4e02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67205387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olivio-git","id":67205387,"login":"olivio-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjA1Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivio-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.g