ma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-05T04:56:59Z","email":"ramakay@me.com","name":"Rama"},"message":"Add LinkedIn post and article about the  Vercel experiment\n\nLinkedIn Post (Naval Ravikant style):\n- Opens with 179-second timeout hook\n- Details the real experience: timeouts and pivots\n- Plain text, no formatting, short paragraphs\n- Circles back to opening about building with constraints\n- Ends with insight: ''I learned to build with what ships''\n\nLinkedIn Article (long-form with code):\n- The 179-Second Timeout That Changed Everything\n- Full technical narrative with code snippets\n- Documents timeout crisis (Grok 28s, Claude 64s, Gemini 179s)\n- Explains pivot to pseudo code (85% token reduction)\n- Shows working code and platform comparisons\n- Vision of Sandbox+Microfrontends future\n- Naval-style clarity with blockquotes for emphasis\n- Ends with invitation to build in the gap\n\nBoth pieces reflect real building experience and lessons learned.","tree":{"sha":"7278fc3a11ef36a893ae0bca0dfb8fe3381e3604","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramakay/vercelship25/git/trees/7278fc3a11ef36a893ae0bca0dfb8fe3381e3604"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramakay/vercelship25/git/commits/f1d08b780981e10575a9b860a5bf0d0abc756c69","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1927846?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramakay/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramakay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramakay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramakay/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramakay","id":1927846,"login":"ramakay","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5Mjc4NDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramakay/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramakay/received_events","repo