2025-07-04T21:00:21Z","email":"ramakay@me.com","name":"Rama"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-04T21:00:21Z","email":"ramakay@me.com","name":"Rama"},"message":"Document real building experience and challenges in README\n\n- Changed perspective from ''we'' to ''I'' throughout for personal narrative\n- Added detailed ''Building Experience'' section documenting:\n  - Timeout crisis: Grok 28s, Claude 64s, Gemini 179s timeouts\n  - The pivot to pseudo code that reduced times to <80s\n  - Judge panel visibility issues and z-index problems\n  - Token counting property name changes in AI SDK v5\n  - Fixed height requirement for model cards\n  - Web search simulation challenges\n  - Environment variable sync delays\n- Updated microfrontends vision: each AI runs in own sandbox\n  - Judge evaluates running artifacts, not just text\n  - Think ''CodeSandbox on steroids''\n  - Transform from ''who writes better text'' to ''who builds better software''\n- Fixed roadmap to remove quarters, focus on feature availability\n- Corrected AI Gateway status from Alpha to Open Beta\n\nThis provides honest documentation of the challenges faced and solutions found.","tree":{"sha":"53342720aefee82029bf130c253e82e247e909fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramakay/vercelship25/git/trees/53342720aefee82029bf130c253e82e247e909fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramakay/vercelship25/git/commits/351f9885254764c2a7c7e8e02f19dff74da313ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1927846?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramakay/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramakay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramakay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramakay/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramakay","id":1927846,"login":"ramaka