","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramakay/vercelship25/commits/1b4ddd93e45f1b4c0869f472e454274d28516d6a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-04T20:54:33Z","email":"ramakay@me.com","name":"Rama"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-04T20:54:33Z","email":"ramakay@me.com","name":"Rama"},"message":"Enhance README with clear prototype description and features roadmap\n\n- Added ''What This Prototype Demonstrates'' section explaining the AI Showdown concept\n- Created features table showing what we actually use vs what''s not accessible\n- Expanded ''Vercel Ship 2025 Features We Actually Use'' with code examples\n- Added detailed future roadmap for Sandbox, Queues, and Microfrontends\n- Updated technical architecture section with real code snippets\n- Clarified the pivot story and lessons learned\n- Fixed component paths to reflect actual structure\n- Added clear distinction between production (/) and mock (/showdown-anime) routes\n\nThe README now clearly communicates:\n1. This is an interactive AI model comparison tool, not just a feature test\n2. We use AI Gateway, Active CPU, AI SDK v5, and Edge Functions in production\n3. Sandbox and Queues integration planned for when they become available\n4. Microfrontends architecture envisioned for embeddable AI components\n5. Technical implementation details with actual code from the project","tree":{"sha":"bbd739008cbfe3681f83e4bb59d4119a24e01cd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramakay/vercelship25/git/trees/bbd739008cbfe3681f83e4bb59d4119a24e01cd4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramakay/vercelship25/git/commits/1b4ddd93e45f1b4c0869f472e454274d28516d6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1927846?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramakay/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramakay/