,"email":"ramakay@me.com","name":"Rama"},"message":"Add critical finding about AI Gateway cost API limitation\n\n- Add new ''Cost & Usage API'' item to needs improvement section\n- Note that gateway costs and credits are unavailable via API\n- Mention this was confirmed by Vercel''s AI chat support\n- Highlight that apps cannot adapt behavior based on usage/cost\n\nThis is a significant limitation for production applications that\nneed to manage costs dynamically or implement usage-based features.","tree":{"sha":"06f9923e97ee5550dd6a18e56ce32d4db8c32585","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramakay/vercelship25/git/trees/06f9923e97ee5550dd6a18e56ce32d4db8c32585"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramakay/vercelship25/git/commits/5addb27deee72ca5eae290996bc80a497520a6e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1927846?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramakay/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramakay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramakay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramakay/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramakay","id":1927846,"login":"ramakay","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5Mjc4NDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramakay/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramakay/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramakay/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramakay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramakay/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramakay","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ramakay/vercelship25/commit/5addb27deee72ca5eae290996bc80a497520a6e4","node_id":"C_kwDOPFZeldoAKDVhZGRiMjdkZWVlNzJjYTVlYWUyOTA5OTZiYzgwYTQ5NzUyMGE2ZT