"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjM5Mzgx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-dilip/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-dilip/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-dilip/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-dilip/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-dilip/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-dilip","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahesh-dilip/ideaforgev1/commits/c50f0a27b5f1abe9dce56fe3987927845d7878e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T00:11:27Z","email":"mahesh.dilip.96@gmail.com","name":"Mahesh Dilip"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T00:11:27Z","email":"mahesh.dilip.96@gmail.com","name":"Mahesh Dilip"},"message":"Convert orchestrator subsystem from CommonJS to ESM so it actually runs\n\nThe backend declares \"type\": \"module\" and server.js imports the orchestrator,\nhelpers, validation, and prompts as ESM, but those files used CommonJS\n(require/module.exports) — so the parallel orchestrator + quality-retry path\nthrew on load and was effectively dead code.\n\n- prompts/*.js: module.exports = X  ->  export default X\n- prompts/index.js: require() -> import (with .js extensions); expose both\n  named exports and a default object (server.js imports default, orchestrator\n  reads prompts.principiaPrompt)\n- config/model-config.js, helpers/agent-helpers.js, validation/quality-checker.js,\n  orchestrator/workflow-orchestrator.js: require -> import (.js extensions),\n  module.exports -> export/export default\n- agent-helpers.js: initialize the Gemini client lazily via getGenAI() instead of\n  throwing at import time, so the module is importable without a key while still\n  failing loudly on an actual call. Logic otherwise unchanged.\n\nserver.js and the live per-agent endpoints are untouched. node --check passes on\nall changed files + server.js; importing the orchestrator with no API key now\nresolves cleanly (smoke test OK).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"89e407a74067ac46d4464d0b7a21a0da85cec7cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahesh-dilip/ideaforgev1/git/trees/89e407a74067ac46d4464d0b7a21a0da85cec7cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahesh-dilip/ideaforgev1/git/commits/c50f0a27b5f1abe9dce56fe3987927845d7878e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87639381?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-dilip/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-dilip/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-dilip/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-dilip/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mahesh-dilip","id":87639381,"login":"mahesh-dilip","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjM5Mzgx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-dilip/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-dilip/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-dilip/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-dilip/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-dilip/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-dilip","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mahesh-dilip/ideaforgev1/commit/c50f0a27b5f1abe9dce56fe3987927845d7878e1","node_id":"C_kwDOPFxBLdoAKGM1MGYwYTI3YjVmMWFiZTlkY2U1NmZlMzk4NzkyNzg0NWQ3ODc4ZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mahesh-dilip/ideaforgev1/commit/0c563ca62c311db0827e2010ad7b2bb339ea9724","sha":"0c563ca62c311db0827e2010ad7b2bb339ea9724","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahesh-dilip/ideaforgev1/commits/0c563ca62c311d